  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Added support for context-closed middleware.\n\n      Middleware can now be defined in two supported shapes:\n      - ICommandMiddleware<TCommand, TContext> (fully open, classic)\n      - ICommandMiddleware<TCommand> with context inferred at compile time\n\n      Context-closed middleware is strictly validated at build time:\n      - must be open generic with arity 1 or 2\n      - arity-1 middleware must implement exactly one ICommandMiddleware<TCommand, TContext>\n      - context type must exactly match the one configured via UseTinyDispatcher<TContext>\n\n      Generated pipelines correctly close middleware based on arity.\n      No breaking changes. Existing middleware continues to work unchanged.",
